      "instance_name": "misogynous_stereotype",
      "label": "Misogynous Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that women are valued primarily for their physical appearance, particularly their breasts, reducing their worth to sexualized body parts. This is a common misogynistic trope that objectifies women and implies their value lies in their physical attributes rather than their talent, character, or contribution to media.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
