    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_475bc4e2",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "man_in_foreground",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The central figure in the meme, a bald man in a movie theater, is portrayed as the target of the meme's message. He is depicted as self-aware and smirking while holding popcorn, directly engaging the viewer. His role as the speaker of the text 'i'm just here for the boobs' makes him the focal point for the meme's intended audience, who are meant to recognize and relate to his ironic, detached, and objectifying perspective on the cinematic experience. The meme's humor and toxicity rely on the audience understanding his persona as a representative of a specific, often satirical, type of viewer.",
